    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are proud to present this magnificent and beautifully appointed top floor penthouse apartment located in one of the most exclusive and sought after gated communities in Drumcondra. Situated in a superb location just off the mature tree lined Griffith Avenue, properties in this exceptional development rarely come to the market, especially in such turnkey condition throughout. Behind the handsome exterior lies approximately 75 m² / 807 ft² of luxury accommodation complemented by it's bright light-filled interior enjoying a sunny south facing private rooftop terrace, with a separate communal rooftop garden available to all residents. Built circa. 2006, No. 24 was the 'Show House' apartment  and is a light filled dream home that offers stunning private views across Griffith Avenue and further into Dublin City and the Wicklow Mountains.\r\n\r\nAs you exit the lift and make it to the front door, the entrance hallway greets you with wooden flooring and high ceilings which set the tone for this picture perfect property throughout. Off the hallway is a stunning light filled open plan living and dining area, with the discreet kitchen area located to the right hand side. The accommodation is spacious and well laid out, with two double bedroom including a master bedroom with a fully tiled ensuite and three storage units for additional convenience located off the main hall. As a top floor penthouse, the level of privacy cannot be understated. The south facing private terrace bathes the property in natural light throughout the day and into the evening, with the aded advantage of a larger than normal balcony area that is part of the communal roof top garden for this exclusive development.  \r\n\r\nNo. 24 Rosemont is situated ideally just off the mature Griffith Avenue, which runs through Glasnevin, Drumcondra and on down to Marino, with local shops directly opposite the development. The location is simply superb within walking distance of the City Centre and convenient to the numerous shops, cafes, bars and restaurants Drumcondra Village and Fairview has to offer. Dublin City University is within easy walking distance and with a variety of good sports clubs, Botanic Gardens, a great selection of national and secondary schools, Churches, Hospitals and Medical Centres locally. Commuting further afield is made very easy with the M50, M1 Motorways and Dublin Airport within a few minutes' drive. The area is very well serviced by public transport, through many bus routes which pass close by. Drumcondra Rail Station and Clontarf DART station are within easy reach. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful penthouse has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690"
      },
      {
